# Adjudicated punused findings. CI runs punused per directory and matches each
# finding line against the literal substrings below: an unmatched finding fails
# the build, an unmatched entry warns as stale. The "#" lines above each entry
# carry its reason.

# Error() satisfies the builtin error interface, which punused cannot see
# (bep/punused#3). appTokenMinter.attempt returns a *githubAPIError for every
# non-2xx answer, and its text reaches the run's failure log through
# httpx.Do and execute's `github app token request failed` line.
# TestExecute_AReflectedJWTNeverReachesTheLog pins that rendered text.
method (*githubAPIError).Error
